  "title": "Spicy Beef Curry Stew for the Slow Cooker",
  "description": "This hearty, spicy beef stew is only for those that can handle the heat. I prefer to make it in the slow cooker, but it can be made stove top also. Great served over mashed potatoes or rice.",
  "authors": [
